title: "Non-Linear Control of a 2-DOF Robotic Arm: Modeling, Simulation, and Embedded Firmware"
abstract: "We present the Euler-Lagrange modeling, computed-torque feedback linearization, linear and Lie-bracket controllability verification, Simulink Stateflow simulation, and Arduino AVR/ESP32 firmware for a planar 2-DOF robotic arm."
